\node[cell, minimum width=\colA, below=0pt of d1.south west, anchor=north west] (e1) {};
\node[cell, minimum width=\colB, right=0pt of e1] (e2) {};
\node[cell, minimum width=\colC, right=0pt of e2] (e3) {Entertainment};
\node[cell, minimum width=\colD, right=0pt of e3] (e4) {\$3600};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Calculate Zoe's total income, total expenses, and net annual budget balance.

